      "text": "**Section 4. Power and Duties.** The Board may adopt such resolutions and make such recommendations to the Chief Medical Examiner and/or to the Mayor regarding the operations, performance and needs of the Office of Chief Medical Examiner and its personnel as it deems appropriate.",
